@startuml SystemArchitecture
' AesirWarden · static source/asset mapping · 2026-09-29
' Source presence does not prove a complete UE episode or packaged deployment.
title AesirWarden - 核心组件边界（源码/资产可定位）
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAF7
left to right direction

actor 玩家
package "Unreal Engine 5.8 / AesirWarden" {
  [玩家战斗与输入] as Player
  [Boss Observation] as Observation
  [BT_AesirBoss] as BT
  [Policy Client] as Client
  [Boss Action Component] as Action
  [GAS / ASC / GA / GE] as GAS
  [Telemetry / Reward] as Telemetry
  [GameMode / Result UI] as Match
}
cloud "本机 Python Boss 推理 :8012\n冻结 PPO" as Python

玩家 --> Player
Player --> Observation : 战斗状态
Observation --> Client : v4 / 26 特征
BT --> Action : 高层动作
Client --> Python : HTTP 决策
Python --> Client : Action ID 0..8
Client --> Action : 同一动作边界
Action --> GAS : 校验并激活
Action --> Telemetry : typed Outcome
GAS --> Telemetry : 战斗结果
GAS --> Match : 胜负事实
note bottom of Python
  模型完整 UE Episode、故障回退和
  Windows 部署仍待运行验证。
end note
@enduml
